{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a0b980fc1788d85f6db3f2bdb3a2b02a.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/a0b980fc1788d85f6db3f2bdb3a2b02a.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across a dying realm consumed by divine conflict. As mortal champions resurrected by the Goddess of Light, you and your party must push back the encroaching darkness before the realm is overtaken by evil. Every step through the dying lands uncovers hidden relics, forgotten lore, and the realm\u2019s fragile balance between hope and corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b7c9a10a42b935710bc32c8445fd0a8f.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/b7c9a10a42b935710bc32c8445fd0a8f.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based tactical battles where positioning, timing, and resource management decide survival. Every decision whether striking an enemy, casting a spell, or even defending builds Ultimate Charge, fueling powerful Ultimate Abilities unique to each hero. Shatter enemy lines, rally your allies, or unleash unstoppable force with these devastating Ultimates when the balance of battle hangs by a thread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.poster.avif?t=1761976190\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.webm?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.mp4?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/5ff3fb9057e4d5e65278b8821c3fff25.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/5ff3fb9057e4d5e65278b8821c3fff25.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=197 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/e88d1051f88d227ac6756e4e399560d6.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/e88d1051f88d227ac6756e4e399560d6.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 playable heroes, each with 3 distinct subclasses that reshape their powers and playstyle. With over 150 abilities, mechanic-shifting Blessings, and more than 200 unique<strong> </strong>items, every run offers a new path to mastery. Whether you reflect damage back at your foes, cripple them with layered debuffs, or dominate with raw ability power - each run forges new strategies as unique as the heroes themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/2ec06e931a170fff0b187d4de8066f6f.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/2ec06e931a170fff0b187d4de8066f6f.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your champions alone or rally up to three friends in fast-paced co-op play. With simultaneous turns for all players, battles remain fluid, tactical, and unrelenting as you fight for the realm\u2019s survival together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.poster.avif?t=1761976190\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.webm?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.mp4?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1761976190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1761976190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/c898c2e2b7ca6f6deb12fe3bff991f94796d0b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761976190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/c898c2e2b7ca6f6deb12fe3bff991f94796d0b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761976190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General fantasy medieval violence against heroes, NPCs, and enemies."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Playtest NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we gear up to launch our public demo later this month, we're looking for play testers to try out the game <strong>EARLIER!</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Play Tester, you'll get early access to Act 1 now, and Acts 2 + 3 as they became available in our Playtest Realm later this year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to get your hands Forsworn now, join the Official Discord and request a Steam Playtest Key - join the fight, leave feedback, and hangout with other adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a0b980fc1788d85f6db3f2bdb3a2b02a.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/a0b980fc1788d85f6db3f2bdb3a2b02a.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across a dying realm consumed by divine conflict. As mortal champions resurrected by the Goddess of Light, you and your party must push back the encroaching darkness before the realm is overtaken by evil. Every step through the dying lands uncovers hidden relics, forgotten lore, and the realm\u2019s fragile balance between hope and corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b7c9a10a42b935710bc32c8445fd0a8f.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/b7c9a10a42b935710bc32c8445fd0a8f.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based tactical battles where positioning, timing, and resource management decide survival. Every decision whether striking an enemy, casting a spell, or even defending builds Ultimate Charge, fueling powerful Ultimate Abilities unique to each hero. Shatter enemy lines, rally your allies, or unleash unstoppable force with these devastating Ultimates when the balance of battle hangs by a thread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.poster.avif?t=1761976190\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.webm?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.mp4?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/5ff3fb9057e4d5e65278b8821c3fff25.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/5ff3fb9057e4d5e65278b8821c3fff25.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=197 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/e88d1051f88d227ac6756e4e399560d6.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/e88d1051f88d227ac6756e4e399560d6.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 playable heroes, each with 3 distinct subclasses that reshape their powers and playstyle. With over 150 abilities, mechanic-shifting Blessings, and more than 200 unique<strong> </strong>items, every run offers a new path to mastery. Whether you reflect damage back at your foes, cripple them with layered debuffs, or dominate with raw ability power - each run forges new strategies as unique as the heroes themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/2ec06e931a170fff0b187d4de8066f6f.avif?t=1761976190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/2ec06e931a170fff0b187d4de8066f6f.webp?t=1761976190 width=1560 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your champions alone or rally up to three friends in fast-paced co-op play. With simultaneous turns for all players, battles remain fluid, tactical, and unrelenting as you fight for the realm\u2019s survival together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.poster.avif?t=1761976190\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.webm?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.mp4?t=1761976190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Resummon Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/2093264c66c2e9f05db245dbed06b25da4f95ae7/header.jpg?t=1761976190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560360/665175267/ad3aeaef5555454f16e8ba6a9934f75730022d62/1761680758/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761683548","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560360/665175267/ad3aeaef5555454f16e8ba6a9934f75730022d62/1761680758/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761683548","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3560360/665175267/ad3aeaef5555454f16e8ba6a9934f75730022d62/1761680758/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761683548","id":257223823,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223823/movie480.mp4?t=1761683548","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223823/movie_max.mp4?t=1761683548"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223823/cbc471d7f84c59f912db73a02502c93efa033023/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761683548","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223823/movie480.webm?t=1761683548","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223823/movie_max.webm?t=1761683548"}}],"name":"